      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, i'm working on a paper about how nations maintain their cultural identity over long periods of time. can you help me outline some of the main factors that contribute to a strong, cohesive national identity and why its important for a country to keep its core traditions intact during times of rapid social change?",
